{"symbol":"ATG.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:47:16Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Dwa Swiaty 1","city":"Bielany Wroclawskie","zip":"55-040","country":"Poland","phone":"48 71 776 4700","fax":"48 71 776 4701","website":"https://www.atmgrupa.pl","industry":"Entertainment","industryKey":"entertainment","industryDisp":"Entertainment","sector":"Communication Services","sectorKey":"communication-services","sectorDisp":"Communication Services","longBusinessSummary":"ATM Grupa S.A., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a television and film production company in Poland and internationally. It operates through five segments: Television and Film Production; Fixed Asset Management; Development Activities; Computer Game Production; and Other Activities. The company offers assistance from the early stages of pre-production to the finishing phase of post-production; postproduction services for films, such as media storage, film and sound editing, voice over recording, colour correction, and exporting media; rental services for film studio, OB vans, and production equipment and accessories, including cameras, lenses, lightning, and grip and sound equipment; and back-office, support, logistics, development, and localizing services. It also produces light entertainment, films, fictional series, documentary-style series, documentary, and animated films. In addition, the company is involved in implementation of construction projects related to the construction of residential and non-residential buildings; production of mobile games and applications for iOS, Android, and Mac platforms, as well as the provision of advertising space. Further, it engages in the sales of goods; sale of investment properties; provision of accounting services; and event management activities. ATM Grupa S.A. was founded in 1992 and is headquartered in Bielany Wroclawskie, Poland.","companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Przemyslaw  Kmiotek","title":"President of Management Board & CEO","fis